        How to Organize Kitchen Cabinets: Practical Storage Tips for Malaysian Homes
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--warm-gray); margin-bottom: 0;">Published by Choice Kitchen Cabinet &bull; Practical Home Improvement Tips</p>
    </header>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 36px; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
